   ],
   "spoken": "A map every Sicilian player needs: from the standard tabiya there are four great highways — the Najdorf with a6, the Classical or Rauzer with the knight to c6, the Dragon with g6, and the Kan or Scheveningen family with e6. Which one you drive determines your whole answer to the early knight to c3.",
