   "line": [
    "g4"
   ],
   "spoken": "Why did the pure Scheveningen fall from fashion? Because of the sharp pawn storm with g4 — a genuinely dangerous plan that puts the defender under real pressure. Keeping the e-pawn back a step delays that thrust, which is part of the appeal of the flexible move order.",
