   "spoken": "Against the kingside pawn storm, the right idea is h6 — not to prevent the knight lunge, which can't be stopped, but to draw its sting. If it lunges and is met by the capture, the recapture weakens the opponent's grip on the central squares, and a knight will land on the resulting e5 outpost as a monster. The half-open file it opens is of no concern.",
